  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_0178.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Multitudin&agrave;ria romeria i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_0492.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>cant de l&#39;himne, del patr&oacute; d&#39;Onda, amb actuacions dels grups Els Ravalers i Els Moriscos,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_0217.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>i Fireta comercial. A m&eacute;s de</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_0509.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>l&#39;actuaci&oacute; del Grup Folc&oacute;ric d&#39;Onda.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_0537.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>&#39;Sonia y sus Secuaces&#39; a Man&aacute; Bar, en sessions de vesprada i nit.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/NitDelSalvador-77.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La Supermagic per a tancar el Recinte Multiusos a la matinada ja dimarts 6 d&#39;agost.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_0189.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Missa a l&#39;aire lliure sota una gran carpa a l&#39;explanada de l&#39;ermita.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/08/IMG_0003.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>I process&oacute; m&eacute;s humil al carrer del Salvador.</p>\n<p></p>\n"
